# Election inputs, their provenance records (SOURCES.json) and EDT-generated
# evidence are deliberately versioned, although the repository .gitignore
# ignores *.json and *.csv. The source watcher's publisher stages with
# `git add`, so anything ignored here would silently never be published
# (tests/test_election_watch.py checks these paths).
!data/**/*.csv
!data/**/*.csv.xls
!data/**/*.json
!reports/**/*.json
!reports/**/county-breakdown.csv
